            "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The World Tour update has smashed into <strong><i>Make Way</i></strong>, featuring a whirlwind of free new features by popular demand:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Mode:</strong> Work with teammates to beat your opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight new vehicles: </strong>Randy the Dog from Wobbledogs, three wild vehicles based on our creator friends Nogla, PietSmiet, and Party Crashers, and the four winners of our Community Design-A-Car Competition, namely Fred the Duck, Es-Car-Go Snail, DISGHOST, and Doug the Fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three new environments:</strong> Speed through the Tropical Island, Lunar Surface, and Toy Room worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved matchmaking</strong> and peer-to-peer services with EOS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Server list feature</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New track piece odds</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/98126edc6d4d5287a5d7301713e6ec49.avif?t=1790865580\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras_big/98126edc6d4d5287a5d7301713e6ec49.avif?t=1790865580 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How much is that wobbledoggy in the window? Nothing! It’s completely free!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As well as the World Tour update, don’t miss the new Legends Vehicle Pack DLC, featuring ten iconic vehicles including the SpookyMobile, The Continuum, the Soul Patrol, the Road Reaper, and the Desert Stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/5eb233bc41dcd53c96d47e719509cc74.avif?t=1790865580\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras_big/5eb233bc41dcd53c96d47e719509cc74.webp?t=1790865580 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Make Way</i></strong> is classic, top-down, multiplayer racing shifted up multiple gears. It's a party game at heart, inspired by the chaotic racing of <i><strong>Mashed </strong></i>and<strong><i> Micro Machines</i></strong>, and the course-building mayhem of <strong><i>Ultimate Chicken Horse</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab track pieces from a pick n mix menu and snap them together to build your first course. Dodge hazards, unleash weaponry, and avoid falling off the edge in a chaotic rush to the finish line, then bolt on new track pieces for the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/9cde0c90c2a24f07cd008decdb06ac6e.poster.avif?t=1790865580\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/9cde0c90c2a24f07cd008decdb06ac6e.webm?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/9cde0c90c2a24f07cd008decdb06ac6e.mp4?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrap across ever-growing courses with increasingly perilous features until a winner is crowned before starting over with a brand-new course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your course</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together—or against one another—to quickly build tracks using a range of ridiculous pieces, including loops, seesaws, corkscrews, and even train crossings. Then add obstacles and power-ups. Ruin your friends’ race with a well-placed barrier or jettison them off the side of a curve with a crafty boost-pad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/a3a8e2a03e1dbd85dd2ec488fee8fa65.poster.avif?t=1790865580\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/a3a8e2a03e1dbd85dd2ec488fee8fa65.webm?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/a3a8e2a03e1dbd85dd2ec488fee8fa65.mp4?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blow up the competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six racers jostle and shunt to cross checkpoints and reach the finish line. Obliterate opponents with a range of wacky weapons, including goo cannons and Tesla coils, but beware: each checkpoint acts as a respawn point and revenge is a dish best served via a giant mallet or rooftop-mounted shotgun… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/eafdf813a1504c17de007ce728e30932.poster.avif?t=1790865580\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/eafdf813a1504c17de007ce728e30932.webm?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/eafdf813a1504c17de007ce728e30932.mp4?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add to your collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new track pieces and hazards for more dangerous course designs. Add new vehicles to your garage to romp to victory in style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/17996949f20ffb8549443a845bef5220.poster.avif?t=1790865580\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/17996949f20ffb8549443a845bef5220.webm?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/17996949f20ffb8549443a845bef5220.mp4?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep on truckin’</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The finish line isn’t the finish! Add new track pieces after each round to create monstrously large courses, and score bonus points with your performance to take home the trophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/3841b1e47c7ea3b6f46c9f46ee0e9080.poster.avif?t=1790865580\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/3841b1e47c7ea3b6f46c9f46ee0e9080.webm?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/3841b1e47c7ea3b6f46c9f46ee0e9080.mp4?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match unique track pieces and hazards for near-endless course configurations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for weapons and power-ups to gain the advantage </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new track pieces and vehicles for wackier races </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to six players, on the same screen or online with cross-platform multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle traps and safety barriers on or off to make those twisty turns easier (or more perilous!) using fully customisable rulesets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now includes the World Tour update, adding an additional eight vehicles, three track environments, Team Mode, and more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/c0ee8eeff57b9ba91c1ef88b70e75fb7.poster.avif?t=1790865580\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/c0ee8eeff57b9ba91c1ef88b70e75fb7.webm?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/c0ee8eeff57b9ba91c1ef88b70e75fb7.mp4?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make Way's solo developer previously worked on <i><strong>Toybox Turbos</strong></i> and the <i><strong>Micro Machines</strong></i> series.</p>",
