_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new track pieces and vehicles for wackier races </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to six players, on the same screen or online with cross-platform multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle traps and safety barriers on or off to make those twisty turns easier (or more perilous!) using fully customisable rulesets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now includes the World Tour update, adding an additional eight vehicles, three track environments, Team Mode, and more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/c0ee8eeff57b9ba91c1ef88b70e75fb7.poster.avif?t=1790865580\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/c0ee8eeff57b9ba91c1ef88b70e75fb7.webm?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445790/extras/c0ee8eeff57b9ba91c1ef88b70e75fb7.mp4?t=1790865580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make Way's solo developer previously worked on <i><strong>Toybox Turbos</strong></i> and the <i><strong>Micro Machines</strong></i> series.</p>",
